  "releaseNotes": "Add Utf8Extensions and enhance HttpModel:\n      - Introduce Utf8Extensions.ToUtf8String for decoding ReadOnlySpan<byte> to UTF‑8.\n      - Expand HttpModel with improved XML docs and span-backed APIs: generic span setters, integer overloads for SetHeader/AddHeader, fluent Clear, and simplified SetContentLengthHeader.\n      - Add new body-building and parsing helpers — a SetBody overload to concatenate multiple HttpModel instances, ParseFull and ParseHeadersInternal for parsing complete messages (returning total bytes consumed), and SplitToModels for splitting concatenated messages into pooled models.\n      - Also add StorageData constants ModelNumber and ApplicationOctetStream. These changes improve allocation-free construction and parsing of pooled, span-backed HTTP models and enable efficient handling of concatenated model streams.",
